WEBVTT

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:11.860
MOBILE SUIT
<b>GUNDAM
VICTORY</b>

00:01:27.360 --> 00:01:30.660
Pressing in on the battleship Tassilo and Maria were aboard,

00:01:31.060 --> 00:01:35.600
Üso managed to kill Tassilo, though Maria died in the chaos.

00:01:37.060 --> 00:01:41.760
Üso was left wracked with guilt.

00:01:43.460 --> 00:01:48.700
But, heedless of the feelings of a lone boy pilot,

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:51.560
the battlefield turned toward the final showdown.

00:01:52.130 --> 00:01:54.830
ATOP THE ANGEL'S HALO

00:01:54.830 --> 00:01:57.830
"Atop the Angel's Halo".
ATOP THE ANGEL'S HALO

00:02:02.830 --> 00:02:06.660
You're careless if you think this isn't a mobile suit.

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:13.160
Where are you, Üso?

00:02:14.060 --> 00:02:17.530
Surely you'll come for the all-out attack!

00:02:35.860 --> 00:02:38.300
I won't engage any mobile suits or tires!

00:02:38.360 --> 00:02:41.430
I just need to get to where Shahkti is!

00:02:41.560 --> 00:02:43.860
I'll generate the light wings to use as a barrier!

00:02:50.660 --> 00:02:53.830
The Shrike Team is late! Late, but they've arrived!

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:55.060
I appreciate it!

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:58.330
They're reliable friends who always have my back!

00:02:58.700 --> 00:02:59.830
Do we stop?

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:01.000
We don't stop!

00:03:01.030 --> 00:03:03.800
Your adrenaline level is too high! Stop!

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:05.100
All right!

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:11.730
Üso, can you hear me?

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:14.060
I've brought some new support parts for you.

00:03:14.100 --> 00:03:17.400
Cony, Juca, once I've released the assault parts,

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:19.660
keep the enemy away from us.

00:03:19.700 --> 00:03:23.960
Üso, jettison the Buster and equip the assault parts!

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:27.060
Miss Marbet, you shouldn't be out here!

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:29.460
Miliera, Frannie, you cover us, too!

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:33.000
Cony, give them a hand, too.

00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:37.800
Roger. Marbet, explain it to Üso!

00:03:38.100 --> 00:03:39.830
We're in the middle of a battlefield!

00:03:39.860 --> 00:03:43.530
And if we die, we die. It'll just be our unlucky day.

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:44.700
But...

00:03:44.730 --> 00:03:48.100
Üso, you're doing well. Almost too well.

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:49.430
Thank you.

00:03:49.460 --> 00:03:54.060
Which is why the old men on the Reineforce made this Assault armor for you.

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:55.500
Assault armor?

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:00.760
Just don't overdo things.

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:02.030
I know.

00:04:03.030 --> 00:04:04.360
All set over here!

00:04:04.660 --> 00:04:06.800
You got the left shoulder parts ready?

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:13.400
Karl's telling us where to find Shahkti. There's no doubt about it.

00:04:13.460 --> 00:04:17.300
All that's left is for you to fly to Angel Halo without fail.

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:20.100
I know. You mean I have to stay calm, right?

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:25.960
The baby... Do you feel it?

00:04:26.230 --> 00:04:29.530
I don't think I can, with your pilot suit in the way.

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:45.300
Marbet, how long are you going to spoil Üso?

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:47.760
You attach the knee pads.

00:04:47.900 --> 00:04:50.600
I'm going to mount the Buster and beam launcher.

00:04:50.660 --> 00:04:52.330
Roger, roger!

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:56.430
Üso gets so carried away, I need to carefully explain things to him.

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:57.960
You got it, Üso?

00:04:58.030 --> 00:04:58.960
Yeah, yeah.

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:01.760
Cony, Marbet, what are you doing?

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:03.730
Hurry up, before we're in trouble here!

00:05:04.100 --> 00:05:06.660
How much longer will this take, Miss Marbet?

00:05:09.730 --> 00:05:11.600
Mobile suits keep getting in my way!

00:05:12.900 --> 00:05:15.460
There's a unit on the battlefield that's not moving?

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:21.030
l know exactly what's there. I can tell.

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:26.230
Incoming! A powerful cannon!

00:05:27.630 --> 00:05:29.930
Is it the mobile suit on the saucer again?!

00:05:30.400 --> 00:05:31.500
I see them!

00:05:31.530 --> 00:05:36.200
The ones not moving in the middle of the battlefield are Üso and his friends!

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:46.960
Miss Marbet, get out of here!

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:50.100
Shrike Team, Tomáš, Odelo, clear a path!

00:05:52.100 --> 00:05:54.130
If you're coming, then come for me!

00:05:57.560 --> 00:06:00.630
He's telling me where he is? There?

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:03.200
If it's coming from the side...

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:05.230
Miss Marbet, get back!

00:06:07.830 --> 00:06:12.000
Miss Marbet, you've done your job. Get back to the White Ark.

00:06:12.200 --> 00:06:14.500
But, we can't let them near us!

00:06:14.760 --> 00:06:18.360
What? You're afraid of the fighting?

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:19.830
Who's saying that?!

00:06:19.930 --> 00:06:20.930
What are you talking about?

00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:21.960
Odelo!

00:06:22.130 --> 00:06:24.530
I heard you over the skin touch circuit.

00:06:24.700 --> 00:06:29.160
Mr. Oliver must be making your baby talk to you, Miss Marbet.

00:06:29.260 --> 00:06:32.030
Oliver? Oliver is...

00:06:32.230 --> 00:06:35.660
Miss Marbet, please, make sure we have a place to come back to!

00:06:35.960 --> 00:06:37.200
Understood.

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:40.160
I'll protect that place.

00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:41.830
I'll fortify the White Ark!

00:06:43.930 --> 00:06:45.200
Cannon is losing!

00:06:45.230 --> 00:06:46.300
I know!

00:06:46.330 --> 00:06:47.200
Do something else!

00:06:47.230 --> 00:06:48.100
I am!

00:06:48.230 --> 00:06:50.530
That V-shaped afterimage faded away?

00:06:54.130 --> 00:06:56.100
Luring me with light...

00:06:56.730 --> 00:07:00.360
Like I'd fall for that. Where do I sense you, Üso?!

00:07:00.400 --> 00:07:02.460
Take care of things, Cony, Juca!

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:04.300
Roger, Marbet!

00:07:04.330 --> 00:07:07.360
We have to protect new life, is that it?

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:08.700
No, no!

00:07:08.730 --> 00:07:13.260
I want to see how Marbet and Oliver's baby resembles them!

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:14.600
That's true.

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:28.330
Stop throwing your lives away! Is it that ship?

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:34.730
She's here! Miss Katejina!

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:40.860
I'll teach you how heavy weaponry just slows a mobile suit down!

00:07:47.630 --> 00:07:48.430
They got you!

00:07:48.460 --> 00:07:49.560
No, they haven't!

00:07:52.630 --> 00:07:55.160
You pompous, self-righteous little child...

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:56.200
Begone!

00:07:57.730 --> 00:07:59.030
The wings are shining?!

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:03.130
He got away!

00:08:03.530 --> 00:08:04.900
I'm sorry!

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:25.960
Shahkti!

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:27.230
Shahkti!

00:08:30.960 --> 00:08:33.000
You! Imperial guard tire!

00:08:33.060 --> 00:08:35.530
The white one has infiltrated Angel Halo!

00:08:35.930 --> 00:08:39.060
White one? The Gundam team?

00:08:39.100 --> 00:08:43.030
What kind of defender doesn't notice an enemy mobile suit slipping in?!

00:08:43.060 --> 00:08:44.660
You call yourself an imperial guard?

00:08:44.700 --> 00:08:46.000
Come with me!

00:08:51.660 --> 00:08:53.460
That's the center of the rings.

00:08:53.700 --> 00:08:55.630
It looks easy enough to get into, but...

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:58.200
Wakkas! Lots of wakkas!

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:04.400
The way they're moving... it's almost like they're luring me.

00:09:04.430 --> 00:09:08.260
Üso, there are gates scattered around the ring's exterior.

00:09:08.300 --> 00:09:12.230
I know. The lights in front of me are showing me that, too.

00:09:13.700 --> 00:09:15.860
Üso! It's a trap!

00:09:16.960 --> 00:09:21.200
Are you almost done deciphering Angel Halo's structure, Üso?

00:09:21.300 --> 00:09:24.000
Concentrate on the Gundam to lure it in! Fire!

00:09:29.400 --> 00:09:32.860
I see! There's something important at that gate!

00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:34.560
Does it lead to the center?

00:09:40.060 --> 00:09:42.460
They destroyed one of Angel Halo's rings?

00:09:52.500 --> 00:09:55.430
What? All these people...

00:09:55.960 --> 00:09:59.060
They're not military. Not soldiers.

00:09:59.260 --> 00:10:00.930
The psychickers?!

00:10:03.300 --> 00:10:05.500
Miss Juca, don't be reckless!

00:10:05.530 --> 00:10:07.300
And don't attack the rings directly!

00:10:07.700 --> 00:10:09.300
A suicide run?

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:11.630
Keep it away from the gate! Fall!

00:10:13.060 --> 00:10:17.100
The child Marbet will bear belongs to all of us!

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:19.160
You people wouldn't understand what that means!

00:10:21.030 --> 00:10:25.530
I need to go tell all the others who left before us!

00:10:27.660 --> 00:10:29.560
Miss Juca, no!

00:10:33.930 --> 00:10:38.460
Kid, don't just stand there! Charge into the ring!

00:10:40.260 --> 00:10:41.830
Miss Juca!

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:08.860
After Miss Juca was hit...

00:11:08.900 --> 00:11:11.930
The people... All the people!

00:11:12.360 --> 00:11:14.600
Do we run? Advance?

00:11:15.130 --> 00:11:17.800
If I ran, I could never apologize to Miss Juca!

00:11:17.960 --> 00:11:22.100
Angel Halo's been damaged! It's our chance to get in!

00:11:31.560 --> 00:11:34.760
What's wrong? My head hurts.

00:11:35.430 --> 00:11:37.460
Ring Number 2 and 3, no anomalies.

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:41.800
She's withstanding the effects of Ring Number 5's destruction.

00:11:42.060 --> 00:11:44.930
Yes, sir. The princess is showing a slight headache,

00:11:44.960 --> 00:11:46.160
but she's bearing with it.

00:11:46.200 --> 00:11:47.800
Then let's carry on!

00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:54.500
Inform all forces that we must accelerate Angel Halo's landing on Earth!

00:12:22.800 --> 00:12:27.360
How many thousands of psychickers are they using as a power source?

00:12:28.700 --> 00:12:30.700
We should just destroy it, right?

00:12:30.730 --> 00:12:35.500
That explosion showed us that these rings are full of civilians!

00:12:35.530 --> 00:12:36.760
They're psychickers!

00:12:36.800 --> 00:12:40.830
Once the White Ark locks onto the ring's hull, look for Üso!

00:12:40.860 --> 00:12:41.530
Roger.

00:12:41.560 --> 00:12:42.260
Here it comes!

00:12:42.300 --> 00:12:43.860
Evacuate!

00:12:45.030 --> 00:12:47.100
There are thousands of people here!

00:12:47.130 --> 00:12:48.130
A mobile suit!

00:12:56.260 --> 00:12:59.460
They're fighting in the place they should be protecting!

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:03.360
This passageway should lead directly to the center.

00:13:04.600 --> 00:13:09.330
Did you have us dress this way because my unit is all women?

00:13:09.860 --> 00:13:12.060
There are tens of thousands of psychickers...

00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:14.700
...praying in the rooms lining either side of the ring.

00:13:14.730 --> 00:13:17.000
Unless you fight in a way that will cause your bodies pain,

00:13:17.030 --> 00:13:20.200
you'll have to fight in a way that will kill the psychickers.

00:13:20.230 --> 00:13:21.360
I suppose.

00:13:21.800 --> 00:13:26.660
Besides, Neneka, you all pledged your bodies to the defense of Angel Halo.

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:27.700
Understood!

00:13:27.730 --> 00:13:30.630
This tactic will beat the white one for sure.

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:32.600
For sure?

00:13:32.630 --> 00:13:38.660
Your beautiful bodies will serve to entrance the white ones' pilots.

00:13:39.200 --> 00:13:41.560
Especially that boy.

00:13:45.430 --> 00:13:47.130
A tire. But...

00:13:47.160 --> 00:13:48.560
It's not attacking.

00:13:48.600 --> 00:13:51.000
It's just... rolling.

00:13:52.300 --> 00:13:53.800
An empty tire?

00:13:54.230 --> 00:13:55.230
And another!

00:14:05.160 --> 00:14:08.600
N-Naked girls?! What?!

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:15.760
Are they mocking me? Am I seeing things again?

00:14:19.700 --> 00:14:22.530
It's real! This isn't a dream!

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:26.930
Women! Women! Why women?

00:14:26.960 --> 00:14:27.960
Here it comes!

00:14:28.960 --> 00:14:30.760
I'm sorry if this hurts!

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:36.860
Why naked women? Why?!

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:40.430
This isn't real! It's not! It's not! It's not!

00:14:46.030 --> 00:14:47.630
This isn't war!

00:14:47.660 --> 00:14:49.360
Mobile suit ahead!

00:14:52.960 --> 00:14:55.260
That's a Gun EZ, isn't it? Am I dreaming?

00:14:55.300 --> 00:14:56.560
Nope! Nope!

00:14:56.600 --> 00:14:57.560
Gundam!

00:14:58.660 --> 00:14:59.830
It's a trap?!

00:15:03.760 --> 00:15:05.360
This has to be a dream.

00:15:05.400 --> 00:15:09.330
And this Gun EZ is piloted by Junko or Mahalia, right?

00:15:12.960 --> 00:15:14.230
It moved!

00:15:15.700 --> 00:15:16.930
Üso!!!

00:15:18.230 --> 00:15:19.560
Katejina!!!

00:15:20.360 --> 00:15:21.960
That's not what pilots do!

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:23.530
Were you a bit distracted?

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:26.830
A child who lacks conviction disgusts me!

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:28.000
And I...

00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:31.860
I could never love anyone who'd use such dirty tricks!

00:15:32.030 --> 00:15:35.460
Then try killing me, little boy.

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:40.260
That's playing dirty! It's cowardly!

00:15:40.700 --> 00:15:44.130
Disappear... Please, just disappear!

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:45.860
W-What?!

00:15:48.930 --> 00:15:50.900
He tried to kill me!

00:15:52.900 --> 00:15:57.000
Not only did he shake off the illusions, he's shaken me off, as well.

00:16:04.930 --> 00:16:06.500
The Shrike Team did it!

00:16:06.530 --> 00:16:09.200
Tomáš! Odelo! How's the White Ark?

00:16:09.360 --> 00:16:11.260
Still okay. How about Üso?

00:16:11.630 --> 00:16:13.700
He went inside to find Shahkti.

00:16:13.730 --> 00:16:14.960
And Miss Juca and the others?

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:16.330
Juca's dead.

00:16:16.460 --> 00:16:18.000
They got Miss Juca?

00:16:18.100 --> 00:16:21.330
Tomáš! We're going after Üso!

00:16:21.630 --> 00:16:22.730
Okay, go!

00:16:25.760 --> 00:16:28.800
The Reineforce isn't coming yet, is it?

00:16:29.030 --> 00:16:33.530
Y-Yeah, it looks like the Reineforce still needs to rendezvous with the Jeanne d'Arc.

00:16:33.700 --> 00:16:34.800
Understood.

00:16:34.960 --> 00:16:38.060
Cover the Shrike Team. I'll take us near the entrance.

00:16:45.630 --> 00:16:48.560
I can sense Shahkti behind that wall.

00:17:01.400 --> 00:17:02.430
A child?!

00:17:02.600 --> 00:17:05.460
Wait! Don't use guns near the key room!

00:17:06.400 --> 00:17:09.330
Intruder sighted! All personnel, be on the lookout!

00:17:12.830 --> 00:17:13.900
Strange.

00:17:14.560 --> 00:17:17.360
An intruder, here in the center block?

00:17:21.630 --> 00:17:22.700
It's Kagatie.

00:17:23.660 --> 00:17:24.800
Fonse Kagatie!

00:17:24.830 --> 00:17:25.700
What?!

00:17:26.700 --> 00:17:29.030
How did a child get in here?

00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:32.230
I got in because I am a child! Am I wrong?

00:17:32.500 --> 00:17:36.200
I see. And do you fight because you're a child?

00:17:36.860 --> 00:17:38.830
I fight because Shahkti's a child, too!

00:17:38.860 --> 00:17:42.830
And you seated her at the center of Angel Halo!

00:17:43.200 --> 00:17:44.730
Any closer and I'll shoot!

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:47.960
Living things surpass their parents.

00:17:47.960 --> 00:17:50.230
Parents are supposed to die after giving birth.

00:17:50.560 --> 00:17:53.200
If you've forgotten that truth, then this operation...

00:17:53.360 --> 00:17:55.400
...was doomed from the start!

00:17:55.430 --> 00:17:57.560
You're one to talk, Boy.

00:17:59.100 --> 00:18:01.260
Tomáš, Üso's near!

00:18:01.700 --> 00:18:02.900
How do you know?

00:18:02.930 --> 00:18:05.200
No, I know, too.

00:18:05.430 --> 00:18:08.700
The overpopulated human race has denied that truth.

00:18:08.860 --> 00:18:11.430
It would be best if it just vanished.

00:18:11.600 --> 00:18:16.100
So, the human race gets wiped out because of one conceited old man?!

00:18:16.730 --> 00:18:17.900
Haro!

00:18:18.960 --> 00:18:20.400
Lord Kagatie!

00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:23.430
Why, you!

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:26.730
We'll find a better way!

00:18:26.760 --> 00:18:28.530
Don't be so arrogant, you...

00:18:30.100 --> 00:18:32.160
I'm taking Shahkti back!

00:18:32.360 --> 00:18:35.660
It's that sort of pride that has led mankind astray!

00:18:36.000 --> 00:18:39.430
If we can't do it, the next generation will!

00:18:39.460 --> 00:18:41.360
One wrong move, and I'll shoot!

00:18:41.500 --> 00:18:43.700
Stay there and don't move!

00:18:44.360 --> 00:18:45.530
You did it, Haro.

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:46.930
Üso, it's open!

00:18:52.030 --> 00:18:55.860
We'll have to break through if we're going to help the White Ark!

00:18:55.900 --> 00:18:58.800
Can't we rendezvous with the Jeanne d'Arc?

00:18:59.100 --> 00:19:01.330
We can't depend on a Federation ship!

00:19:01.860 --> 00:19:04.500
I also have the name Jinn Jahannam.

00:19:04.530 --> 00:19:08.630
We need to destroy the Sugan Fleet and somehow reach Angel Halo!

00:19:08.830 --> 00:19:12.360
Well sir, seeing how fired up you are, I'm sure we can do it.

00:19:16.600 --> 00:19:20.130
Shahkti, you don't have to pray anymore.

00:19:20.460 --> 00:19:22.930
We're going to shut down Angel Halo.

00:19:23.830 --> 00:19:25.630
Everyone, we're pulling out!

00:19:26.030 --> 00:19:27.430
Just stay right there!

00:19:27.860 --> 00:19:30.160
We've got a hostage, okay?

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:34.030
We'll see about that.

00:19:34.060 --> 00:19:36.300
In order not to kill the psychickers,

00:19:36.330 --> 00:19:39.160
they didn't cut the power to their capsules.

00:19:39.330 --> 00:19:42.630
Their psycho waves haven't disappeared.

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:52.360
Üso, where do you think we should set explosives?

00:19:52.400 --> 00:19:53.960
We can't!

00:19:54.330 --> 00:19:56.660
There are tens of thousands of psychickers here.

00:19:56.700 --> 00:20:00.530
Angel Halo is like a slave ship. We can't just blow it up!

00:20:00.560 --> 00:20:02.330
Then what should we do?

00:20:02.360 --> 00:20:06.960
Mr. Otis said the sections have independent flight systems.

00:20:07.130 --> 00:20:08.860
So, we just jettison the rings?

00:20:08.900 --> 00:20:10.360
Let's find the controls!

00:20:12.500 --> 00:20:14.960
What? We're entering the atmosphere!

00:20:18.930 --> 00:20:21.130
Üso! What should we do?!

00:20:21.530 --> 00:20:24.860
Aren't the Reineforce or the White Ark nearby?

00:20:24.900 --> 00:20:25.960
There!

00:20:26.460 --> 00:20:29.560
Üso, fall back behind our shield, at once!

00:20:29.960 --> 00:20:32.430
I'm headed for the center of the rings!

00:20:36.660 --> 00:20:38.960
Üso, you're still up to something?

00:20:44.360 --> 00:20:47.660
Hold together till we find an entrance, V2!

00:20:48.260 --> 00:20:49.230
What's wrong?!

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:52.760
Shahkti!

00:21:02.400 --> 00:21:04.530
What's this light?

00:21:04.560 --> 00:21:09.160
Are those people's moans coming from the rings?

00:21:09.630 --> 00:21:10.730
What?!

00:21:27.460 --> 00:21:28.730
Karl?

00:21:29.030 --> 00:21:30.400
This is...

00:21:30.430 --> 00:21:32.030
Shahkti's awake!

00:21:32.760 --> 00:21:35.100
Üso saved you.

00:21:35.200 --> 00:21:38.300
I can't stay here!

00:21:38.330 --> 00:21:39.430
Why not?

00:21:39.700 --> 00:21:43.860
My mind is still resonating with the hearts of a great many people.

00:21:44.600 --> 00:21:47.500
Even though you've left Angel Halo?

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:48.830
Yes.

00:21:52.960 --> 00:21:57.200
Tens of thousands of people are sleeping there,

00:21:57.230 --> 00:22:00.230
and their hearts are now connected to mine.

00:23:30.460 --> 00:23:35.360
The battlefield in space burns with the fires of the Earth's grief.

00:23:36.100 --> 00:23:40.500
The Reineforce and the Shrike Team strike at the enemy's ramparts.

00:23:40.860 --> 00:23:43.730
But hidden in the shadow of the crumbling Angel Halo,

00:23:43.760 --> 00:23:47.330
as though to pay them pack for their grim enterprise,

00:23:47.430 --> 00:23:50.300
is Miss Katejina, loosing beams and swinging a saber.

00:23:51.200 --> 00:23:53.730
Next time, on Mobile Suit Victory Gundam:

00:23:53.760 --> 00:23:57.000
Next Episode A SHOWDOWN DEMANDED BY HATE
"A Showdown Demanded by Hate".

00:23:57.000 --> 00:23:58.460
Please watch it!
